      <uighur>kesik</uighur>
      <cyrillic>хишиг - хэшиг</cyrillic>
      <transcript>KESIG</transcript>
      <definition>n. Grace, favor, blessing; good luck or good fortune; turn (one's place, time, or opportunity in a scheduled or alternating order)</definition>
      <page>460</page>
      <examples>
